  "meaning": "Finite heap root-owner coherent stores, byte patches, heap/fixed source copies, fills, overlapping moves and quantum selected writes. Normal O0/O2 and ASan/UBSan O1; both synthesis policies. Explicit public reduced density formulas with virtual old-value histories, independently evolved physical joint states and full gate inverses; phases, scoped borrows, negative words and post-free outputs. Bool stores/scatter and signed/unsigned 8/16/32-bit scalar/byte profiles; multiword moves/scatter through 16 bits. Two 32-bit destinations plus two full-word histories exceed 128 wires. General lifetimes and 64-bit profiles remain unqualified. A partial fixed-buffer write still dephases an untouched high byte in its active sector. Historical papers and full remote CI are not qualified for these new inputs.",
